{"updated": "2026-08-21T10:45:18.777173+00:00", "fetched": 5, "cache_hits": 3, "bundles": {"4155afa4cdd6": {"label": "cross-asset \u00b7 4 series \u2191", "level": "red", "score": 11.47, "members": ["dyn_mrna", "btc_usd", "eth_usd", "dyn_coin"], "articles": [{"title": "Global Market: European shares little changed as bond yields rise and gulf tensions lift oil", "feed": "ET Markets", "ts": "2026-08-21T10:01:20+00:00", "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/us-stocks/news/global-market-european-shares-little-changed-as-bond-yields-rise-and-gulf-tensions-lift-oil/articleshow/133399383.cms", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "European shares were little changed on Friday, with the STOXX 600 heading for a second straight weekly decline as rising bond yields and higher oil prices weighed on sentiment. Renewed Gulf tensions pushed Brent crude to a one-month high, reviving inflation concerns and complicating the outlook for global monetary policy.\n\n(What's moving Sensex and Nifty Track latest market news, stock tips, Budget 2025, Share Market on Budget 2025 and expert advice, on ETMarkets. Also, ETMarkets.com is now on Telegram. For fastest news alerts on financial markets, investment strategies and stocks alerts, subscribe to our Telegram feeds .)\n\nSubscribe to ET Prime and read the Economic Times ePaper Online.and ", "citation": "Global Market: European shares little changed as bond yields rise and gulf tensions lift oil \u2014 ET Markets, 2026-08-21. https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/us-stocks/news/global-market-european-shares-little-changed-as-bond-yields-rise-and-gulf-tensions-lift-oil/articleshow/133399383.cms"}, {"title": "Global Market: Eurozone bond yields edge lower after turbulent week in global debt markets", "feed": "ET Markets", "ts": "2026-08-21T09:50:32+00:00", "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/us-stocks/news/global-market-eurozone-bond-yields-edge-lower-after-turbulent-week-in-global-debt-markets/articleshow/133400209.cms", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "Eurozone bond yields eased Friday but remained set for weekly gains amid global bond-market stress, persistent inflation and fiscal concerns. Germany\u2019s 10-year yield stood at 3.2445%. Rising oil prices and stronger ECB rate-hike expectations added pressure, with markets pricing over 90% odds of a September rate increase.\n\n(What's moving Sensex and Nifty Track latest market news, stock tips, Budget 2025, Share Market on Budget 2025 and expert advice, on ETMarkets. Also, ETMarkets.com is now on Telegram. For fastest news alerts on financial markets, investment strategies and stocks alerts, subscribe to our Telegram feeds .)\n\nSubscribe to ET Prime and read the Economic Times ePaper Online.and S", "citation": "Global Market: Eurozone bond yields edge lower after turbulent week in global debt markets \u2014 ET Markets, 2026-08-21. https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/us-stocks/news/global-market-eurozone-bond-yields-edge-lower-after-turbulent-week-in-global-debt-markets/articleshow/133400209.cms"}, {"title": "Sensex today | Stock Market Live: Sensex, Nifty trade flat amid weak global cues", "feed": "BusinessLine Mkts", "ts": "2026-08-21T09:48:04+00:00", "url": "https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/markets/sensex-nifty50-today-stock-market-live-updates-21st-august-2026/article71368928.ece", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "Sensex Today, Nifty 50 | Stock Market Highlights, 21st August 2026: Indian equities ended largely flat on Friday, with the Nifty 50 edging up 0.08% to 24,252 and the BSE Sensex closing flat at 77,540.83. Both benchmarks recorded weekly losses of 0.5% and 0.6%, respectively, amid elevated crude oil prices and rising global bond yields.\n\nHigher oil prices, driven by the escalating Middle East conflict, intensified inflation concerns, while rising yields increased borrowing costs and potentially reduced foreign investor appetite for emerging-market equities.\n\nTwelve of 16 major sectors declined over the week. IT stocks fell 2.6% as concerns over US inflation weighed on the sector, while private", "citation": "Sensex today | Stock Market Live: Sensex, Nifty trade flat amid weak global cues \u2014 BusinessLine Mkts, 2026-08-21. https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/markets/sensex-nifty50-today-stock-market-live-updates-21st-august-2026/article71368928.ece"}], "primary_sources": [{"series": "dyn_mrna", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 MRNA", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/MRNA"}, {"series": "btc_usd", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 BTC-USD", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BTC-USD"}, {"series": "eth_usd", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 ETH-USD", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ETH-USD"}, {"series": "dyn_coin", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 COIN", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/COIN"}], "analogues": {"member_z_today": {"dyn_mrna": -0.73, "btc_usd": 5.64, "eth_usd": 3.83, "dyn_coin": -1.52}, "analogues": [{"date": "2025-08-13", "distance": 1.26, "member_z": {"dyn_mrna": -1.05, "btc_usd": 3.24, "eth_usd": 3.74, "dyn_coin": -0.82}}, {"date": "2025-05-09", "distance": 2.19, "member_z": {"dyn_mrna": -1.48, "btc_usd": 1.86, "eth_usd": 3.96, "dyn_coin": 0.54}}, {"date": "2024-11-21", "distance": 2.43, "member_z": {"dyn_mrna": -1.38, "btc_usd": 2.0, "eth_usd": 1.69, "dyn_coin": 0.79}}, {"date": "2024-11-13", "distance": 2.43, "member_z": {"dyn_mrna": -2.76, "btc_usd": 2.99, "eth_usd": 2.04, "dyn_coin": 1.52}}, {"date": "2026-05-05", "distance": 2.47, "member_z": {"dyn_mrna": -1.32, "btc_usd": 2.26, "eth_usd": 0.94, "dyn_coin": 0.55}}], "aftermath": {"dyn_mrna": {"stats": {"+5d": {"n": 4, "median_pct": 1.26, "hit_rate_up": 0.5, "min_pct": -12.34, "max_pct": 14.04}, "+20d": {"n": 5, "median_pct": -1.5, "hit_rate_up": 0.4, "min_pct": -9.59, "max_pct": 7.71}}, "median_path": [0.0, 4.45, 4.2, 4.46, 3.79, 2.52, 7.94, 7.11, 4.99, 3.0, 2.97, 3.02, 5.03, 1.04, 0.69, 1.93, 5.46, 6.56, -1.39]}, "btc_usd": {"stats": {"+5d": {"n": 5, "median_pct": -0.56, "hit_rate_up": 0.4, "min_pct": -7.35, 