-to-near-three-month-peak-after-us-treasury-move/article71372830.ece", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "Gold prices hit a near three-month \u200bhigh on Friday, poised for a third straight \u2060weekly gain, supported by a softer dollar and the US Treasury's bond buyback move.\n\nSpot gold climbed 1% to $4,562.86 per ounce by 0752 GMT, hitting \u200cits highest since May 29 earlier in the session. Prices have climbed 4.2% so far this week. \u200cUS gold futures rose 1.1% to $4,620.00.\n\n\"We've seen the dollar \u200cweakening \u2060and that has supported not just gold but all \u2060precious metals, along with a big change in yields,\" said Brian Lan, managing director of GoldSilver Central.\n\nThe dollar headed for a weekly loss, making greenback-priced bullion more \u200baffordable for buyers overseas. US \u200cTreasury Secretary Scott Bessent", "citation": "Gold climbs to near three-month peak after US Treasury move \u2014 BusinessLine Mkts, 2026-08-21. https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/markets/gold/gold-climbs-to-near-three-month-peak-after-us-treasury-move/article71372830.ece"}, {"title": "Silver price rises \u20b92,369 to \u20b92.45 lakh per kg", "feed": "BusinessLine Mkts", "ts": "2026-08-21T07:43:42+00:00", "url": "https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/markets/gold/silver-price-rises-2369-to-245-lakh-per-kg/article71372688.ece", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "In the overseas market, silver futures increased 1.28% to $68.95 per ounce.\n\nSilver prices rose 0.97 per cent to \u20b92.45 lakh per kg in the futures trade on Friday amid a firm global trend.\n\nOn the Multi Commodity Exchange, the white metal for September delivery increased by \u20b92,369, or 0.97 per cent, to \u20b92,45,612 per kilogram in a business turnover of 2,663 lots.\n\nFresh positions built up by participants led to a rise in silver prices, analysts said.\n\nIn the overseas market, silver futures increased 1.28 per cent to $68.95 per ounce.\n\nComments have to be in English, and in full sentences. They cannot be abusive or personal. Please abide by our community guidelines for posting your comments.\n\nW", "citation": "Silver price rises \u20b92,369 to \u20b92.45 lakh per kg \u2014 BusinessLine Mkts, 2026-08-21. https://www.thehindubusinessline.com/markets/gold/silver-price-rises-2369-to-245-lakh-per-kg/article71372688.ece"}], "primary_sources": [{"series": "comex_gold", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 GC=F", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GC=F"}, {"series": "comex_gold", "name": "CFTC Commitments of Traders", "url": "https://www.cftc.gov/MarketReports/CommitmentsofTraders/index.htm"}, {"series": "comex_silver", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 SI=F", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SI=F"}, {"series": "comex_copper", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 HG=F", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/HG=F"}], "analogues": {"member_z_today": {"comex_gold": -1.33, "comex_silver": -0.39, "gold_silver_ratio": -0.02, "comex_copper": 0.76}, "analogues": [{"date": "2026-05-22", "distance": 0.0, "member_z": {"comex_gold": -1.33, "comex_silver": -0.39, "gold_silver_ratio": -0.02, "comex_copper": 0.76}}, {"date": "2026-05-15", "distance": 0.21, "member_z": {"comex_gold": -1.49, "comex_silver": -0.22, "gold_silver_ratio": -0.3, "comex_copper": 0.58}}, {"date": "2025-07-30", "distance": 0.34, "member_z": {"comex_gold": -1.56, "comex_silver": -0.27, "gold_silver_ratio": -0.44, "comex_copper": 0.31}}, {"date": "2025-10-31", "distance": 0.42, "member_z": {"comex_gold": -0.73, "comex_silver": -0.37, "gold_silver_ratio": -0.45, "comex_copper": 0.37}}, {"date": "2026-05-05", "distance": 0.6, "member_z": {"comex_gold": -1.69, "comex_silver": -1.13, "gold_silver_ratio": 0.32, "comex_copper": -0.02}}], "aftermath": {"comex_gold": {"stats": {"+5d": {"n": 5, "median_pct": 0.87, "hit_rate_up": 0.6, "min_pct": -0.76, "max_pct": 2.67}, "+20d": {"n": 3, "median_pct": -1.46, "hit_rate_up": 0.33, "min_pct": -7.48, "max_pct": 3.3}}, "median_path": [0.0, -0.07, -0.87, -0.05, 0.87, 0.43, 3.11, 2.68, 0.0, 0.