art Solutions among 4 stocks to hit 52-week highs & surge up to 25% in a month", "feed": "ET Markets", "ts": "2026-08-19T12:16:01+00:00", "url": "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/lenskart-solutions-among-4-stocks-to-hit-52-week-highs-amp-surge-up-to-25-in-a-month/slideshow/133348316.cms", "status": "ok", "excerpt": "On Wednesday, the benchmark Sensex fell 325 points to close at 76,909. Despite the broader market weakness, four stocks from the BSE 200 Index touched fresh 52-week highs, marking their strongest price levels in the past year. A 52-week high is generally considered a positive technical indicator, reflecting strong investor interest, improving market sentiment, and the potential for further upward momentum.\n\nNew 52-week high: Rs 3051| CMP: Rs 3034.05. In the last one month stock has gained about 24%.\n\nNew 52-week high: Rs 645.1| CMP: Rs 640. In the last one month stock has gained about 19%.\n\nNew 52-week high: Rs 49129.95| CMP: Rs 48360. In the last one month stock has gained about 18%.\n\nNew 5", "citation": "Lenskart Solutions among 4 stocks to hit 52-week highs & surge up to 25% in a month \u2014 ET Markets, 2026-08-19. https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/lenskart-solutions-among-4-stocks-to-hit-52-week-highs-amp-surge-up-to-25-in-a-month/slideshow/133348316.cms"}], "primary_sources": [{"series": "dyn_lenskart_ns", "name": "Yahoo \u00b7 LENSKART.NS", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/LENSKART.NS"}], "analogues": {"member_z_today": {"dyn_lenskart_ns": 1.8}, "analogues": [{"date": "2026-07-10", "distance": 0.0, "member_z": {"dyn_lenskart_ns": 1.8}}, {"date": "2026-05-29", "distance": 0.13, "member_z": {"dyn_lenskart_ns": 1.67}}, {"date": "2025-12-24", "distance": 0.24, "member_z": {"dyn_lenskart_ns": 1.56}}, {"date": "2026-07-03", "distance": 0.8, "member_z": {"dyn_lenskart_ns": 2.61}}, {"date": "2026-01-02", "distance": 0.9, "member_z": {"dyn_lenskart_ns": 0.9}}], "aftermath": {"dyn_lenskart_ns": {